is frame after all); keep: true keeps only what the frame leaves, the bunches; both halves are placed and sized by the whole model, so they line up. bunches (bunches.mjs): the lifted bunches told apart (triangles in touching cells of cellShare of the height, at least minTris), in rows (rowShare) from the top, left to right; the report lists where each hangs (hangs, m in the rack's frame); bunchOf keeps one, its hang point at the origin.",
